    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5ebac76a1ddc897204f6a54",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌劝她别太勉强自己，\n但青竹回忆主张还是使出全力比较好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db1385674e02dba71fcb4f6ca5fc65caa7b468bba3d2e1e101d344ea0d937385",
