      "uid": "zhcn:05105a6f338e21217a0ea10d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌将参加“有马纪念”。\n“有马纪念”当天，\n举办了一场介绍参赛赛马娘的活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95168fa3fc6d2cf9f7d332f4c15d809f6e6e7ed60af0edf42fadbacbf664ddcc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85316bcee573647d5721c24e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽在活动中从头到尾都低着头。\n她最近状况不太好，\n一直跑不出自己的风格。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f1ea64be85f15cd57c88a5fa8fce6a409dba02b94ef648c87e135416d3fe885",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66dc059b6fcb97af70404e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "小栗帽消沉的样子让八重无敌\n感到非常烦躁。于是她在活动期间\n突然跑到赛道上全力冲刺。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6b0604867d5470b1508e9de88cfc868f429ef425ad95f4bdc6c5ea005670579",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8377d6e72a13b02dd2bf85a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当小栗帽因为察觉骚动而抬起头后，\n八重无敌大声斥责她，并表示小栗帽能将\n观众的声援化为跑步的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8cb5971fccaa8349764b112c5b1fa4577f08c74875362fabd66421e78c5b205c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61bfcd64c33d8a993749164f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以她应该抬起头感受观众们的声援。\n这句话让小栗帽彻底醒悟，\n恢复了平常的气势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9627a3578386b9f7dfa6396065f9ea8c32f1f327ddde5da7e065d92470ec0a2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
