      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人将经典三冠路线设为目标，\n决定参加“每日杯”作为前哨战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51e227669c6f535774fd5b88436e31558cff37f420ce17aac884f15027a49e26",
