      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然最后落败，但她跑出了\n比出道战还要好的表现。接下来终于\n就是经典三冠竞赛“皋月赏”了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c7485f5f7870bdc62605c1d21978d1ca9a72b5a6bd3af2298fc112d4caf4c0d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
